Look at this picture. This is a story about a busy city street.
​There is a big road. The road has many lines.
​Look at the front. There is a car. The car is red and very shiny.
Is the car blue? No, it is not a blue car. It is a red car.
​Look at the road. What are those?
There are yellow lines on the road. This is a crosswalk for people to walk across the street safely.
​Look behind the crosswalk. There are motorbikes. People are riding the motorbikes on the road. They are wearing helmets on their heads.
​Look at the right side. There are people standing on the sidewalk. They are wearing dark clothes. There is also a black motorbike next to them.
​Look up. There are many tall green trees. The trees have beautiful green leaves.
Are the trees small? No, the trees are very tall.
​In the back, across the street, we can see many shops. One shop has a purple sign. Another shop has a bright blue sign. There are also very tall modern buildings behind the trees. The sky is bright. It is morning time.
​Let's ask some simple questions!
​What color is the car in the front?
The car is red.
​Are there trees in the picture?
Yes! There are many tall green trees.
​What color are the lines on the crosswalk?
The lines on the crosswalk are yellow.
